// Title: Kubernetes Secrets Modified or Deleted
// ID: 58d31a75-a4f8-4c40-985b-373d58162ca2
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: kelnage
// Date: 2024-07-11
// Tags: attack.credential-access
// Description: Detects when Kubernetes Secrets are Modified or Deleted.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(objectRef.resource EQUALS "secrets" AND (verb EQUALS "create" OR verb EQUALS "delete" OR verb EQUALS "patch" OR verb EQUALS "replace" OR verb EQUALS "update"))
